              "type": "text",
              "text": "A cylindrical water tank with a closed top and bottom is being designed.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The height of the cylinder is 4 meters more than its radius.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The total surface area of the tank (including top and bottom) is ",
